unding the Israel-Hamas conflict by providing new state curriculum resources for schools. These materials aim to supplement the teaching of world studies and eliminate ignorance that fuels antisemitism and bigotry. The resources include a guide to conscientious conversations on the Israel-Palestine conflict from the Anti-Defamation League, as well as a guide for parents on discussing violence with their children. The conflict between Israel and Hamas in 2021 led to a rise in antisemitic incidents in the US, and Governor Abbott\'s initiative seeks to support the Jewish community and promote education on the topic.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":107},{"index":1,"byte_start":107,"byte_end":261},{"index":2,"byte_start":261,"byte_end":396},{"index":3,"byte_start":396,"byte_end":516},{"index":4,"byte_start":516,"byte_end":633},{"index":5,"byte_start":633,"byte_end":939},{"index":6,"byte_start":939,"byte_end":1090},{"index":7,"byte_start":1090,"byte_end":1555},{"index":8,"byte_start":1555,"byte_end":1831},{"index":9,"byte_start":1831,"byte_end":2146},{"index":10,"byte_start":2146,"byte_end":2348},{"index":11,"byte_start":2348,"byte_end":2501}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":166},{"index":1,"byte_start":166,"byte_end":291},{"index":2,"byte_start":291,"byte_end":493},{"index":3,"byte_start":493,"byte_end":695}]}', 'request_index': 0, 'sentence_indices': [0, 1, 2, 3], 'token_count_measured': True}, 'response': {'choices': [{'finish_reason': 'stop', 'index': 0, 'message': {'content': '0|E|1.00|[0,1]\n1|E|1.00|[2,3]\n2|E|1.00|[5,6]\n3|E|1.00|[7,8]', 'role': 'assistant'}}], 'created': 1791259255, 'id': 'chatcmpl-QeZddXryuXXwTUtLajLA7KoUUvwsJLyy', 'model': 'unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF', 'object': 'chat.completion', 'system_fingerprint': 'b9606-9b4dae81f', 'timings': {'cache_n': 0, 'predicted_ms': 1462.104, 'predicted_n': 60, 'predicted_per_second': 41.03675251555293, 'predicted_per_token_ms': 24.36