rld.\\\\n\\\\npassage 3:Answers. Best Answer: Growth of seedlings is very fast, with young trees known to reach 65 feet tall in 20 years. Growing to heights of 120 feet or more at maturity, most sequoia trees will grow at a rate of 3 to 5 feet per year.Seed production begins at 10–15 years of age. Source(s): http://www.ehow.com/how_6207859_care-pot...rowing to heights of 120 feet or more at maturity, most sequoia trees will grow at a rate of 3 to 5 feet per year. Seed production begins at 10–15 years of age. Source(s): http://www.ehow.com/how_6207859_care-pot...\\\\n\\\\n\\",\\"question\\":\\"how fast do giant sequoias grow\\"}","answer":"Based on the given passages, giant sequoias can grow at a rate of 3 to 5 feet per year.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":81},{"index":1,"byte_start":81,"byte_end":111},{"index":2,"byte_start":111,"byte_end":125},{"index":3,"byte_start":125,"byte_end":229},{"index":4,"byte_start":229,"byte_end":475},{"index":5,"byte_start":475,"byte_end":582},{"index":6,"byte_start":582,"byte_end":724},{"index":7,"byte_start":724,"byte_end":832},{"index":8,"byte_start":832,"byte_end":1027},{"index":9,"byte_start":1027,"byte_end":1093},{"index":10,"byte_start":1093,"byte_end":1141},{"index":11,"byte_start":1141,"byte_end":1307},{"index":12,"byte_start":1307,"byte_end":1412},{"index":13,"byte_start":1412,"byte_end":1575},{"index":14,"byte_start":1575,"byte_end":1744},{"index":15,"byte_start":1744,"byte_end":1792},{"index":16,"byte_start":1792,"byte_end":1897}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":87}]}', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF', 'seed': 70781, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}, 'rendered_input_tokens': 946, 'rendered_prompt': '<|im_start|>user\n{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addres