\'ve reviewed the food!  Got there an hour and 20 min before closing and was told the kitchen is closed before they\'re out of food. Also took about 5 min to be acknowledged by anyone.\\"}],\\"state\\":\\"CA\\"}","answer":"Pace food+drink is a local restaurant located at 413 State St, Santa Barbara, CA. This restaurant is known for its American (New) cuisine and has received a 4-star business rating. It operates from Tuesday to Saturday, with extended hours on Thursday, Friday, and Saturday till 10 pm. The restaurant offers street parking and is well-suited for groups. It also features a casual ambiance and provides takeout services, although it does not offer outdoor seating, WiFi, or music. Customer reviews highlight the friendly service, the laid-back atmosphere, and the exceptional food, particularly the Caesar salad and the Huli Huli Chicken dish. However, some customers expressed dissatisfaction over the restaurant\'s early kitchen closing hours.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":784},{"index":1,"byte_start":784,"byte_end":805},{"index":2,"byte_start":805,"byte_end":851},{"index":3,"byte_start":851,"byte_end":925},{"index":4,"byte_start":925,"byte_end":935},{"index":5,"byte_start":935,"byte_end":991},{"index":6,"byte_start":991,"byte_end":1079},{"index":7,"byte_start":1079,"byte_end":1098},{"index":8,"byte_start":1098,"byte_end":1129},{"index":9,"byte_start":1129,"byte_end":1327},{"index":10,"byte_start":1327,"byte_end":1395},{"index":11,"byte_start":1395,"byte_end":1518},{"index":12,"byte_start":1518,"byte_end":1625},{"index":13,"byte_start":1625,"byte_end":1693}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":82},{"index":1,"byte_start":82,"byte_end":181},{"index":2,"byte_start":181,"byte_end":285},{"index":3,"byte_start":285,"byte_end":353},{"index":4,"byte_start":353,"byte_end":479},{"index":5,"byte_start":479,"byte_end":642},{"index":6,"byte_start":642,"byte_end":742}]}', 'role': 'us