rs a variety of cuisines, including Burgers, Cafes, Restaurants, Mexican, and American (Traditional). It operates from Tuesday to Sunday, from 8:00 AM to 8:30 PM. The business has parking available in a lot, and it also provides outdoor seating. However, there is no WiFi available at the restaurant.\\n\\nCustomers have given Cal Taco an average rating of 4.0 stars. One recent review mentioned a negative experience with a rude employee who took the phone order and made mistakes with the food order and the bill. Another review highlighted the delicious adobado burrito and tacos, praising the decent prices and generous portions. Additionally, customers appreciate the burgers offered at Cal Taco, with the option to choose from American, cheddar, or Jack cheese. The fries are described as having a nice texture compared to other fast food options.\\n\\nOverall, Cal Taco is known for its diverse menu options, including burgers, Mexican cuisine, and American classics. The restaurant has received positive feedback for its tasty food, although there have been some issues with customer service.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":1382},{"index":1,"byte_start":1382,"byte_end":1555},{"index":2,"byte_start":1555,"byte_end":1625},{"index":3,"byte_start":1625,"byte_end":1701},{"index":4,"byte_start":1701,"byte_end":1778},{"index":5,"byte_start":1778,"byte_end":1803},{"index":6,"byte_start":1803,"byte_end":1929},{"index":7,"byte_start":1929,"byte_end":2008},{"index":8,"byte_start":2008,"byte_end":2067},{"index":9,"byte_start":2067,"byte_end":2118},{"index":10,"byte_start":2118,"byte_end":2187},{"index":11,"byte_start":2187,"byte_end":2327},{"index":12,"byte_start":2327,"byte_end":2483}],"answer_sentence_indices":[8,9,10,11],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":81},{"index":1,"byte_start":81,"byte_end":202},{"index":2,"byte_start":202,"byte_end":263},{"index":3,"byte_start":263,"byte_end":346},{"index":4,"byte_start":346,"byte_end":402},{"index"