h as outdoor seating, takeout options, and was also suitable for group dining. However, it did not provide wifi or music. It was also known for its casual and romantic ambience. The restaurant was rated 3.5 stars overall, with reviews highlighting the quality of the food, especially the brunch and crepes. However, some customers raised concerns over their service. The French Table is no longer in business and has since been replaced by Piano Gastrolounge.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":906},{"index":1,"byte_start":906,"byte_end":963},{"index":2,"byte_start":963,"byte_end":1060},{"index":3,"byte_start":1060,"byte_end":1157},{"index":4,"byte_start":1157,"byte_end":1176},{"index":5,"byte_start":1176,"byte_end":1256},{"index":6,"byte_start":1256,"byte_end":1451},{"index":7,"byte_start":1451,"byte_end":1513},{"index":8,"byte_start":1513,"byte_end":1744},{"index":9,"byte_start":1744,"byte_end":1788},{"index":10,"byte_start":1788,"byte_end":1899},{"index":11,"byte_start":1899,"byte_end":1974},{"index":12,"byte_start":1974,"byte_end":2001},{"index":13,"byte_start":2001,"byte_end":2063},{"index":14,"byte_start":2063,"byte_end":2084},{"index":15,"byte_start":2084,"byte_end":2118}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":83},{"index":1,"byte_start":83,"byte_end":207},{"index":2,"byte_start":207,"byte_end":330},{"index":3,"byte_start":330,"byte_end":373},{"index":4,"byte_start":373,"byte_end":429},{"index":5,"byte_start":429,"byte_end":558},{"index":6,"byte_start":558,"byte_end":618},{"index":7,"byte_start":618,"byte_end":710}]}', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF', 'seed': 70781, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}, 'rendered_input_tokens': 1356, 'rendered_prompt': '<|im_start|>user\n{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relati