psized after being touched or swamped by a cargo ship that came to its aid. Survivors have told the UNHCR that they were crowded on the highest part of the boat, while many others were trapped in the lower areas. Italian authorities, however, have disputed this version of events, claiming that the migrants themselves caused the boat to capsize by rushing to one side. The cargo ship, King Jacob, has been accused of causing the tragedy, but the company that manages it has denied these allegations. The incident has highlighted the challenges faced by commercial vessels in responding to the escalating migrant crisis in the Mediterranean. Shipping companies have complained that they are being unfairly burdened with the responsibility of rescuing migrants, and have called for greater support from European governments. The EU has proposed a 10-point plan to address the crisis, including increasing resources at sea and sharing responsibility for the resettlement and relocation of refugees. However, some groups have criticized the plan as too little, too late.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":206},{"index":1,"byte_start":206,"byte_end":221},{"index":2,"byte_start":221,"byte_end":448},{"index":3,"byte_start":448,"byte_end":673},{"index":4,"byte_start":673,"byte_end":758},{"index":5,"byte_start":758,"byte_end":930},{"index":6,"byte_start":930,"byte_end":1110},{"index":7,"byte_start":1110,"byte_end":1213},{"index":8,"byte_start":1213,"byte_end":1309},{"index":9,"byte_start":1309,"byte_end":1376},{"index":10,"byte_start":1376,"byte_end":1571},{"index":11,"byte_start":1571,"byte_end":1677},{"index":12,"byte_start":1677,"byte_end":1848},{"index":13,"byte_start":1848,"byte_end":2070},{"index":14,"byte_start":2070,"byte_end":2182},{"index":15,"byte_start":2182,"byte_end":2306},{"index":16,"byte_start":2306,"byte_end":2445},{"index":17,"byte_start":2445,"byte_end":2573},{"index":18,"byte_start":2573,"byte_end":2648},{"index":19,"byte_start":2648,"byte_end":281