g other topics. In contrast, information technology (IT) primarily deals with the application of computer systems and technology to manage and process information. IT is concerned with the practical aspects of using computers and telecommunications equipment to store, retrieve, and transmit information in various settings, such as businesses, organizations, and homes.\\n\\nTherefore, computer science provides the technical foundation for IT, while IT applies these technical principles to solve real-world problems and improve productivity, efficiency, and decision-making. IT professionals typically focus on the implementation, management, and maintenance of computer systems and networks, while computer scientists explore new technologies and develop innovative solutions to complex problems.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":100},{"index":1,"byte_start":100,"byte_end":445},{"index":2,"byte_start":445,"byte_end":581},{"index":3,"byte_start":581,"byte_end":605},{"index":4,"byte_start":605,"byte_end":712},{"index":5,"byte_start":712,"byte_end":1002},{"index":6,"byte_start":1002,"byte_end":1105},{"index":7,"byte_start":1105,"byte_end":1303}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":241},{"index":1,"byte_start":241,"byte_end":415},{"index":2,"byte_start":415,"byte_end":563},{"index":3,"byte_start":563,"byte_end":771},{"index":4,"byte_start":771,"byte_end":973},{"index":5,"byte_start":973,"byte_end":1195}]}', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF', 'seed': 70781, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}, 'rendered_input_tokens': 779, 'rendered_prompt': '<|im_start|>user\n{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.","source":"{\\"passages\\":\\"passage 1:Information technology can be considered as a subset o