he shrimp quesadilla, enchilada verde, and chilaquiles. Customers also appreciate the friendly staff and romantic atmosphere. Some reviewers have noted that the restaurant can get busy and noisy, but overall, Rose Cafe No 2 is a great choice for those looking for delicious Mexican cuisine in a relaxed setting.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":790},{"index":1,"byte_start":790,"byte_end":828},{"index":2,"byte_start":828,"byte_end":1041},{"index":3,"byte_start":1041,"byte_end":1137},{"index":4,"byte_start":1137,"byte_end":1292},{"index":5,"byte_start":1292,"byte_end":1474},{"index":6,"byte_start":1474,"byte_end":1627},{"index":7,"byte_start":1627,"byte_end":1742}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":202},{"index":1,"byte_start":202,"byte_end":288},{"index":2,"byte_start":288,"byte_end":361},{"index":3,"byte_start":361,"byte_end":553},{"index":4,"byte_start":553,"byte_end":623},{"index":5,"byte_start":623,"byte_end":808}]}', 'request_index': 0, 'sentence_indices': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5], 'token_count_measured': True}, 'response': {'choices': [{'finish_reason': 'stop', 'index': 0, 'message': {'content': '0|C|1.00|[]\n1|C|1.00|[]\n2|C|1.00|[]\n3|C|1.00|[]\n4|C|1.00|[]\n5|C|1.00|[]', 'role': 'assistant'}}], 'created': 1791259637, 'id': 'chatcmpl-oS2q5q0I7wPiQigz3ao3DRhzloei9adi', 'model': 'unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF', 'object': 'chat.completion', 'system_fingerprint': 'b9606-9b4dae81f', 'timings': {'cache_n': 49, 'predicted_ms': 1602.575, 'predicted_n': 66, 'predicted_per_second': 41.18371995070434, 'predicted_per_token_ms': 24.281439393939394, 'prompt_ms': 962.067, 'prompt_n': 996, 'prompt_per_second': 1035.2709322739477, 'prompt_per_token_ms': 0.9659307228915662}, 'usage': {'completion_tokens': 66, 'prompt_tokens': 1045, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'cached_tokens': 49}, 'total_tokens': 1111}}, 'source_cluster_id': 'sha256:fb03137003e483f43849afe1c9216b8a8097955dbd04d1e3366c3707c50855ac', 'started_