 bordering on bad..let\'s just say I could have done better myself. But I did like the garlic bread.\\"}],\\"state\\":\\"CA\\"}","answer":"Pasta House, located at 6546 Pardall Rd, Goleta, CA, is an Italian restaurant that does not take reservations and offers outdoor seating and takeout services. The restaurant, which opens at unspecified hours, is good for groups but does not offer WiFi, music, or any specific ambience. According to customer reviews, the Pasta House has an average rating of 3 stars. Some customers have raised concerns about the quality of the food, stating that the pasta appears to be frozen and reheated, resulting in less-than-ideal texture and taste. Others have criticized the long wait times and the high prices for the mediocre quality of the dishes. Positive comments include the availability of outdoor seating and the decent portion sizes.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":655},{"index":1,"byte_start":655,"byte_end":668},{"index":2,"byte_start":668,"byte_end":802},{"index":3,"byte_start":802,"byte_end":969},{"index":4,"byte_start":969,"byte_end":1053},{"index":5,"byte_start":1053,"byte_end":1095},{"index":6,"byte_start":1095,"byte_end":1197},{"index":7,"byte_start":1197,"byte_end":1330},{"index":8,"byte_start":1330,"byte_end":1358},{"index":9,"byte_start":1358,"byte_end":1493},{"index":10,"byte_start":1493,"byte_end":1745},{"index":11,"byte_start":1745,"byte_end":1865},{"index":12,"byte_start":1865,"byte_end":1904},{"index":13,"byte_start":1904,"byte_end":1960},{"index":14,"byte_start":1960,"byte_end":2177},{"index":15,"byte_start":2177,"byte_end":2349},{"index":16,"byte_start":2349,"byte_end":2398}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":159},{"index":1,"byte_start":159,"byte_end":286},{"index":2,"byte_start":286,"byte_end":367},{"index":3,"byte_start":367,"byte_end":540},{"index":4,"byte_start":540,"byte_end":643},{"index":5,"byte_start":643,"byte_end":734}]}', 're