l.\\nThere was also chatter about the same hairdresser they use being brought up, which could have started it all.\\nAllegedly, Jennifer pushed Danielle, and she crumbled up a plastic cup and then threw it at Jennifer, drawing blood.\\nBoth women were suspended from filming The Real Housewives of New Jersey but were cleared to return shortly after.\\nNow, both Danielle and Jennifer will have an interesting time at the reunion and as the season plays out. There are several weeks left for filming, which means anything could happen.\\nMoving forward, it will be interesting to see where the loyalties lie, especially with this altercation still fresh in everyone’s mind. It’s clear Teresa Giudice rolls with Jennifer, and Melissa Gorga rides with Danielle.\\nThe Real Housewives of New Jersey is currently on hiatus.","answer":"Jennifer Aydin, a star on The Real Housewives of New Jersey, returned to social media after taking a break following an altercation with Danielle Cabral. The two women had gotten into an argument during an event that resulted in the drawing of blood. No one knows exactly what caused the argument, but it is said that Jennifer pushed Danielle and Danielle threw a cup of water at Jennifer. Both women were suspended from filming, but were later cleared to return. Despite the incident, Jennifer made sure to include Teresa Giudice in her social media post to show their friendship remains strong.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":186},{"index":1,"byte_start":186,"byte_end":328},{"index":2,"byte_start":328,"byte_end":448},{"index":3,"byte_start":448,"byte_end":610},{"index":4,"byte_start":610,"byte_end":792},{"index":5,"byte_start":792,"byte_end":908},{"index":6,"byte_start":908,"byte_end":1047},{"index":7,"byte_start":1047,"byte_end":1213},{"index":8,"byte_start":1213,"byte_end":1249},{"index":9,"byte_start":1249,"byte_end":1386},{"index":10,"byte_start":1386,"byte_end":1494},{"index":11,"byte_start":1494,"byte_end":1552},{"index":12,"