 March, the FBI has begun assisting in the investigation, with an agent specializing in missing persons slated to collaborate with local authorities.\\nAs days turn into weeks, Alexis\'s family remains hopeful for her safe return. While her whereabouts and the circumstances surrounding her disappearance remain a mystery, her loved ones are united in their efforts to bring her home.","answer":"Here is a summary of the article within 95 words:\\n\\nAlexis Ware, a 29-year-old mother, disappeared in South Carolina on February 18th after dropping off her children at a gas station. Her car was later found in another town with no signs of foul play, but she remains missing. Extensive searches and investigations have yielded no concrete leads, and the family is now seeking FBI involvement. Despite this, they remain hopeful for Alexis\'s safe return.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":179},{"index":1,"byte_start":179,"byte_end":318},{"index":2,"byte_start":318,"byte_end":444},{"index":3,"byte_start":444,"byte_end":551},{"index":4,"byte_start":551,"byte_end":635},{"index":5,"byte_start":635,"byte_end":692},{"index":6,"byte_start":692,"byte_end":764},{"index":7,"byte_start":764,"byte_end":867},{"index":8,"byte_start":867,"byte_end":954},{"index":9,"byte_start":954,"byte_end":1068},{"index":10,"byte_start":1068,"byte_end":1144},{"index":11,"byte_start":1144,"byte_end":1261},{"index":12,"byte_start":1261,"byte_end":1343},{"index":13,"byte_start":1343,"byte_end":1502},{"index":14,"byte_start":1502,"byte_end":1587},{"index":15,"byte_start":1587,"byte_end":1700},{"index":16,"byte_start":1700,"byte_end":1816},{"index":17,"byte_start":1816,"byte_end":1918},{"index":18,"byte_start":1918,"byte_end":2058},{"index":19,"byte_start":2058,"byte_end":2150},{"index":20,"byte_start":2150,"byte_end":2311},{"index":21,"byte_start":2311,"byte_end":2389},{"index":22,"byte_start":2389,"byte_end":2542}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_star