 olive oil before adding the steaks will help to caramelize the surfaces of the fish and lock in the moisture.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":46},{"index":1,"byte_start":46,"byte_end":86},{"index":2,"byte_start":86,"byte_end":241},{"index":3,"byte_start":241,"byte_end":364},{"index":4,"byte_start":364,"byte_end":388},{"index":5,"byte_start":388,"byte_end":428},{"index":6,"byte_start":428,"byte_end":697},{"index":7,"byte_start":697,"byte_end":731},{"index":8,"byte_start":731,"byte_end":815},{"index":9,"byte_start":815,"byte_end":938}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":122},{"index":1,"byte_start":122,"byte_end":182},{"index":2,"byte_start":182,"byte_end":302},{"index":3,"byte_start":302,"byte_end":404},{"index":4,"byte_start":404,"byte_end":540},{"index":5,"byte_start":540,"byte_end":711}]}', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF', 'seed': 70781, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}, 'rendered_input_tokens': 798, 'rendered_prompt': '<|im_start|>user\n{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.","source":"{\\"passages\\":\\"passage 1:1 Add the tuna steaks. 2  The steaks should sizzle when added. 3  Cook, uncovered, for 6 to 9 minutes or until fish begins to flake when tested with a fork but is still pink in the center, turning once during cooking. 4  Adjust the heat as needed if the skillet gets too hot.\\\\n\\\\npassage 2:1 Heat the skillet over medium-high heat until hot. 2  Add the tuna steaks. 3  The steaks should sizzle when added. 4  Cook, uncovered, for 6 to 9 minutes or until fish begins to flake when tested with a fork but is still pink in the center, turning once during cooking.\\\\n\\\\npassage 3:Searing tuna steaks in a hot skillet caramelizes the surfaces of the fish and loc