erns at a time when officer-involved shootings have led to protests throughout the nation. Scott, of the Black Ministerial Alliance of Greater Boston, said Moynihan was shot \\"assassination-style.\\" He called for calm in Roxbury. \\"This is not about \'Black Lives Matter,\' \\" he said, referring to a protest movement that emerged after the shootings. \\"It\'s about \'All Lives in the Community Matter,\' and it\'s about the police ... responding to a concern from the community.\\" CNN\'s Ann O\'Neill contributed to this report.\\n","answer":"Boston prosecutors released a video of the shooting that led to the killing of a black gunman named Angelo West. The officer shot, John Moynihan, is white and has a history of gun convictions. Moynihan is currently in a medically induced coma and recovering. The police commissioner stated that the officers involved did not want to use their firearms and that the shooting was unprovoked. The community leader and clergyman urged calm and transparency. The woman driving by at the time of the shooting sustained a flesh wound, but no other officers or passengers were injured. The two passengers in the car were arrested on unrelated charges.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":160},{"index":1,"byte_start":160,"byte_end":206},{"index":2,"byte_start":206,"byte_end":268},{"index":3,"byte_start":268,"byte_end":427},{"index":4,"byte_start":427,"byte_end":477},{"index":5,"byte_start":477,"byte_end":555},{"index":6,"byte_start":555,"byte_end":697},{"index":7,"byte_start":697,"byte_end":750},{"index":8,"byte_start":750,"byte_end":883},{"index":9,"byte_start":883,"byte_end":968},{"index":10,"byte_start":968,"byte_end":1117},{"index":11,"byte_start":1117,"byte_end":1249},{"index":12,"byte_start":1249,"byte_end":1346},{"index":13,"byte_start":1346,"byte_end":1381},{"index":14,"byte_start":1381,"byte_end":1439},{"index":15,"byte_start":1439,"byte_end":1503},{"index":16,"byte_start":1503,"byte_end":1557},{"index":17,"byte_st