olice said in a statement. \\"In the days after the shooting, John and his family have been strengthened, humbled and inspired by the outpouring of love and support they\'ve received -- not only from his closest friends and fellow officers -- but also from concerned citizens and strangers from all over the country wishing him a full and speedy recovery.\\" A woman who was driving by at the time of the shooting suffered a flesh wound in the right arm. She was not identified. Two passengers in the car were arrested on unrelated charges involving an outstanding warrant and a probation violation. \\"None of our officers like to use their firearms,\\"  Police Commissioner William Evans said at the time. \\"It\'s probably the worst thing we have to do in our profession, but here, clearly unprovoked, one of our officers is shot point-blank in the face.\\" In April 2013, Moynihan was among officers who helped save transit officer Richard H. Donohue Jr., who was shot during a gunfight involving Tamerlan and Dzhokhar Tsarnaev in the days after the marathon bombings. In the battle, police fired nearly 300 rounds within five to 10 minutes. Moynihan and other Massachusetts officers were cited for their \\"heroic and relentless\\" life-saving measures on Donohue, who nearly lost his entire blood volume on the Watertown street. At a White House ceremony in May, President Barack Obama honored Moynihan and 52 other officers as \\"America\'s Top Cops.\\" After Moynihan was wounded and West killed, police and and local leaders sought to allay community concerns at a time when officer-involved shootings have led to protests throughout the nation. Scott, of the Black Ministerial Alliance of Greater Boston, said Moynihan was shot \\"assassination-style.\\" He called for calm in Roxbury. \\"This is not about \'Black Lives Matter,\' \\" he said, referring to a protest movement that emerged after the shootings. \\"It\'s about \'All Lives in the Community Matter,\' and it\'s about the police ... responding to a concern from the community.\\" CNN\'s Ann O\'Neill contributed to this report.\\n","answer":"Boston prosecutors released a video of the shooting that led to the killing of a black gunman named Angelo West. The officer shot, John Moynihan, is white and has a history of gun convictions. Moynihan is currently in a medically induced coma and recovering. The police commissioner stated that the officers involved did not want to use their firearms and that the shooting was unprovoked. The community leader and clergyman urged calm and transparency. The woman driving by at the time of the shooting sustained a flesh wound, but no other officers or passengers were injured. The two passengers in the car were arrested on unrelated charges.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":160},{"index":1,"byte_start":160,"byte_end":206},{"index":2,"byte_start":206,"byte_end":268},{"index":3,"byte_start":268,"byte_end":427},{"index":4,"byte_start":427,"byte_end":477},{"index":5,"byte_start":477,"byte_end":555},{"index":6,"byte_start":555,"byte_end":697},{"index":7,"byte_start":697,"byte_end":750},{"index":8,"byte_start":750,"byte_end":883},{"index":9,"byte_start":883,"byte_end":968},{"index":10,"byte_start":968,"byte_end":1117},{"index":11,"byte_start":1117,"byte_end":1249},{"index":12,"byte_start":1249,"byte_end":1346},{"index":13,"byte_start":1346,"byte_end":1381},{"index":14,"byte_start":1381,"byte_end":1439},{"index":15,"byte_start":1439,"byte_end":1503},{"index":16,"byte_start":1503,"byte_end":1557},{"index":17,"byte_start":1557,"byte_end":1652},{"index":18,"byte_start":1652,"byte_end":1979},{"index":19,"byte_start":1979,"byte_end":2075},{"index":20,"byte_start":2075,"byte_end":2099},{"index":21,"byte_start":2099,"byte_end":2220},{"index":22,"byte_start":2220,"byte_end":2324},{"index":23,"byte_start":2324,"byte_end":2472},{"index":24,"byte_start":2472,"byte_end":2684},{"index":25,"byte_start":2684,"byte_end":2757},{"index":26,"byte_start":2757,"by