business is open seven days a week from 12:00 pm to 21:00 pm, with free WiFi available. It also offers outdoor seating and takes reservations, although it does not validate parking. According to customers, the ambiance is casual and suitable for groups, although one reviewer described it as \\"trendy\\" and \\"upscale.\\"\\n\\nOn the positive side, many reviewers have praised the quality of the sushi, with one reviewer stating that it is \\"amazing\\" and \\"highly affordable.\\" Some have also commended the friendliness and professionalism of the staff, with one reviewer describing them as \\"nicely dressed\\" and \\"always asking about school.\\"\\n\\nHowever, several reviewers have expressed dissatisfaction with the recent price increases and perceived decline in quality. One reviewer stated that the prices are now \\"Nobu-level\\" and that the sushi is \\"mediocre,\\" while another reported a negative experience with rude staff.\\n\\nIn conclusion, Sushiya Express appears to be a popular local business with both strengths and weaknesses. While some customers enjoy its high-quality sushi and casual atmosphere, others have criticized its price increases and poor customer service.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":1015},{"index":1,"byte_start":1015,"byte_end":1075},{"index":2,"byte_start":1075,"byte_end":1167},{"index":3,"byte_start":1167,"byte_end":1190},{"index":4,"byte_start":1190,"byte_end":1236},{"index":5,"byte_start":1236,"byte_end":1384},{"index":6,"byte_start":1384,"byte_end":1463},{"index":7,"byte_start":1463,"byte_end":1526},{"index":8,"byte_start":1526,"byte_end":1582},{"index":9,"byte_start":1582,"byte_end":1635},{"index":10,"byte_start":1635,"byte_end":1681},{"index":11,"byte_start":1681,"byte_end":1756},{"index":12,"byte_start":1756,"byte_end":1886},{"index":13,"byte_start":1886,"byte_end":1918},{"index":14,"byte_start":1918,"byte_end":2046},{"index":15,"byte_start":2046,"byte_end":2073},{"index":16,"byte_start":2073,"byte_end"