ices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.","source":"{\\"address\\":\\"320 S Kellogg Ave\\",\\"attributes\\":{\\"Ambience\\":{\\"casual\\":false,\\"classy\\":true,\\"divey\\":false,\\"hipster\\":false,\\"intimate\\":true,\\"romantic\\":false,\\"touristy\\":false,\\"trendy\\":false,\\"upscale\\":false},\\"BusinessParking\\":{\\"garage\\":false,\\"lot\\":true,\\"street\\":true,\\"valet\\":false,\\"validated\\":false},\\"Music\\":false,\\"OutdoorSeating\\":true,\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\":true,\\"RestaurantsReservations\\":false,\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\":null,\\"WiFi\\":\\"no\\"},\\"business_stars\\":4.5,\\"categories\\":\\"Arts & Entertainment, Jazz & Blues, Lounges, Nightlife, Bars, Cocktail Bars\\",\\"city\\":\\"Goleta\\",\\"hours\\":{\\"Friday\\":\\"17:0-1:0\\",\\"Monday\\":\\"0:0-0:0\\",\\"Saturday\\":\\"17:0-1:0\\",\\"Thursday\\":\\"17:0-1:0\\",\\"Wednesday\\":\\"17:0-1:0\\"},\\"name\\":\\"The Imperial\\",\\"review_info\\":[{\\"review_date\\":\\"2022-01-06 19:15:24\\",\\"review_stars\\":5.0,\\"review_text\\":\\"I\'m thrilled this bar didn\'t go out of business with Covid. It\'s one of my favorite bars I\'ve ever been to. Very relaxed, speakeasy vibe with friendly staff that are happy to make just about any drink you could want. The drinks are strong, their records are great and it\'s cozy enough that you\'ll want to stay for hours.\\"},{\\"review_date\\":\\"2022-01-04 01:15:25\\",\\"review_stars\\":2.0,\\"review_text\\":\\"The one establishment we were unfortunate to not lose with Covid19. Bartenders are not as important as they want to believe or treat you as they are. Smh. @bartenders- your welcome for the business, how about some mutual gratitude instead of clap when you walk in attitude. You think this is our honor to be in your presence. How about being human, and being in service, as you are in the service industry\\"},{\\"review_date\\":\\"2021-12-13 07:47:07\\",\\"review_stars\\":5.0,\\"review_tex