hallenges posed by Covid-19 and praised its speakeasy vibe. They highlighted the friendly staff, strong drinks, and great music selection. Another customer had a less positive experience, mentioning that the bartenders did not provide satisfactory service and lacked gratitude towards patrons. \\n\\nThe bar\'s ambience is described as classy and intimate, with a distinct speakeasy vibe. It is located at the back of a bike shop, giving it a hidden feel. The decor is impressive, with a notable vinyl collection and suitable lighting and furniture. The outdoor area offers additional space and visual diversions. Customers also mentioned the delicious cocktails, such as the Clover Club, Oaxacanut, and a mystery Holiday Special. The Imperial is highly recommended by customers, with one stating that it deserves its five-star reviews.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":841},{"index":1,"byte_start":841,"byte_end":889},{"index":2,"byte_start":889,"byte_end":998},{"index":3,"byte_start":998,"byte_end":1243},{"index":4,"byte_start":1243,"byte_end":1325},{"index":5,"byte_start":1325,"byte_end":1330},{"index":6,"byte_start":1330,"byte_end":1449},{"index":7,"byte_start":1449,"byte_end":1501},{"index":8,"byte_start":1501,"byte_end":1785},{"index":9,"byte_start":1785,"byte_end":1831},{"index":10,"byte_start":1831,"byte_end":1952},{"index":11,"byte_start":1952,"byte_end":2044},{"index":12,"byte_start":2044,"byte_end":2247},{"index":13,"byte_start":2247,"byte_end":2352},{"index":14,"byte_start":2352,"byte_end":2437},{"index":15,"byte_start":2437,"byte_end":2580},{"index":16,"byte_start":2580,"byte_end":2685},{"index":17,"byte_start":2685,"byte_end":2963},{"index":18,"byte_start":2963,"byte_end":2998}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":72},{"index":1,"byte_start":72,"byte_end":186},{"index":2,"byte_start":186,"byte_end":271},{"index":3,"byte_start":271,"byte_end":339},{"index":4,"byte_start":339,"byte_