ress\\":\\"3940 State St\\",\\"attributes\\":{\\"Ambience\\":{\\"casual\\":false,\\"classy\\":false,\\"divey\\":false,\\"hipster\\":false,\\"intimate\\":false,\\"romantic\\":false,\\"touristy\\":false,\\"trendy\\":false,\\"upscale\\":false},\\"BusinessParking\\":{\\"garage\\":false,\\"lot\\":true,\\"street\\":false,\\"valet\\":false,\\"validated\\":false},\\"Music\\":null,\\"OutdoorSeating\\":true,\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\":true,\\"RestaurantsReservations\\":false,\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\":true,\\"WiFi\\":\\"free\\"},\\"business_stars\\":2.5,\\"categories\\":\\"Coffee & Tea, Fast Food, Food, Restaurants, Burgers\\",\\"city\\":\\"Santa Barbara\\",\\"hours\\":{\\"Friday\\":\\"5:0-1:0\\",\\"Monday\\":\\"5:0-23:30\\",\\"Saturday\\":\\"4:0-1:0\\",\\"Sunday\\":\\"4:0-23:30\\",\\"Thursday\\":\\"5:0-23:30\\",\\"Tuesday\\":\\"5:0-23:30\\",\\"Wednesday\\":\\"5:0-23:30\\"},\\"name\\":\\"McDonald\'s\\",\\"review_info\\":[{\\"review_date\\":\\"2022-01-13 07:58:17\\",\\"review_stars\\":5.0,\\"review_text\\":\\"Came in super last minute, normally they are so rude. My fiancé and I were craving McFlurrys ;) you all know... normally the ice cream machine is broken/out of order....\\\\nShe was so sweet she made me my shakes anyways and told me about all the bogo deals!\\\\nShe\'s the kind of gal you want representation your business :) she even got me on another fries and e em a 2 for 6 deal! \\\\nThanks again, Anabelia!\\"},{\\"review_date\\":\\"2021-08-25 21:16:43\\",\\"review_stars\\":2.0,\\"review_text\\":\\"Knocking it down to two stars.  They\'ve been slip sliding downhill lately.  I ordered items including a Big Mac and a few bites in, I noticed there wasn\'t any burger on the top part of the sandwich.  I lifted the bun and saw that only half the patty was there.  Nice.  Also, they had some tattooed gangsta wannabe working the counter for picking up orders.  He called my number and I picked it up and said thank you.  The A hole just looked off to the side and said \\\\\\"yep\\\\\\".  Not loving so much.\\"},{\\"review_date\\":\\"2021-06-08 05:05:52\\",\\"review_stars\\":5.0,\\"review_text\\":\\"Went to UCSB for four years, came back for graduation and stopped at McDonald\'s at 10pm. Best customer service I\'ve ever received. Crazy. The employee Boni truly an amazing, sweet, understanding and patient person. 10/10 service by Boni & I\'ve honestly never been so happy leaving a McDonald\'s, ever in life. Thank you Boni!! U deserve the best!\\"}],\\"state\\":\\"CA\\"}","answer":"McDonald\'s is a fast food restaurant located at 3940 State St in Santa Barbara, CA. It offers a variety of food options including coffee, tea, burgers, and other fast food items. The restaurant is open from 5:00 AM to 11:30 PM from Monday to Thursday, with extended hours until 1:00 AM on Fridays and Saturdays. On Sundays, it is open from 4:00 AM to 11:30 PM.\\n\\nAccording to customer reviews, the service at McDonald\'s can vary. One customer mentioned a positive experience with a friendly and helpful employee named Anabelia. She went out of her way to accommodate their cravings, even offering them additional deals. Another customer, however, had a negative experience with incomplete food and encountered an unfriendly staff member. \\n\\nIn terms of amenities, McDonald\'s offers outdoor seating and free WiFi. It is good for takeout and can accommodate groups. The parking lot is available for customers\' convenience.\\n\\nOverall, McDonald\'s has received mixed reviews, with a rating of 2.5 stars. While some customers have had positive experiences with exceptional service, others have encountered issues with food quality and employee behavior.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":861},{"index":1,"byte_start":861,"byte_end":920},{"index":2,"byte_start":920,"byte_end":1186},{"index":3,"byte_start":1186,"byte_end":1317},{"index":4,"byte_start":1317,"byte_end":1361},{"index":5,"byte_start":1361,"byte_end":1485},{"index":6,"byte_start":1485,"byte_end