s denied these allegations. The incident has highlighted the challenges faced by commercial vessels in responding to the escalating migrant crisis in the Mediterranean. Shipping companies have complained that they are being unfairly burdened with the responsibility of rescuing migrants, and have called for greater support from European governments. The EU has proposed a 10-point plan to address the crisis, including increasing resources at sea and sharing responsibility for the resettlement and relocation of refugees. However, some groups have criticized the plan as too little, too late.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":206},{"index":1,"byte_start":206,"byte_end":221},{"index":2,"byte_start":221,"byte_end":448},{"index":3,"byte_start":448,"byte_end":673},{"index":4,"byte_start":673,"byte_end":758},{"index":5,"byte_start":758,"byte_end":930},{"index":6,"byte_start":930,"byte_end":1110},{"index":7,"byte_start":1110,"byte_end":1213},{"index":8,"byte_start":1213,"byte_end":1309},{"index":9,"byte_start":1309,"byte_end":1376},{"index":10,"byte_start":1376,"byte_end":1571},{"index":11,"byte_start":1571,"byte_end":1677},{"index":12,"byte_start":1677,"byte_end":1848},{"index":13,"byte_start":1848,"byte_end":2070},{"index":14,"byte_start":2070,"byte_end":2182},{"index":15,"byte_start":2182,"byte_end":2306},{"index":16,"byte_start":2306,"byte_end":2445},{"index":17,"byte_start":2445,"byte_end":2573},{"index":18,"byte_start":2573,"byte_end":2648},{"index":19,"byte_start":2648,"byte_end":2813},{"index":20,"byte_start":2813,"byte_end":2982},{"index":21,"byte_start":2982,"byte_end":3143},{"index":22,"byte_start":3143,"byte_end":3243},{"index":23,"byte_start":3243,"byte_end":3416},{"index":24,"byte_start":3416,"byte_end":3584},{"index":25,"byte_start":3584,"byte_end":3826},{"index":26,"byte_start":3826,"byte_end":3869},{"index":27,"byte_start":3869,"byte_end":4046},{"index":28,"byte_start":4046,"byte_end":4142},{"index":29,"byte_start":4142,"byte_end":4314},