st on a woman named Beyonce.\\n","answer":"The entire Star Wars saga is now available on digital HD, and actress Mindy Kaling\'s brother admitted to faking his race to get into medical school, causing controversy about affirmative action. Meanwhile, the fast food chain Burger King is sponsoring the wedding of Joel Burger and Ashley King, who have gained internet fame for their aptly named union. In entertainment news, fans of the CW series \\"The Vampire Diaries\\" are mourning the departure of star Nina Dobrev, and the cast of the upcoming movie \\"Suicide Squad\\" assembled for the first time in a photo on Twitter.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":174},{"index":1,"byte_start":174,"byte_end":234},{"index":2,"byte_start":234,"byte_end":260},{"index":3,"byte_start":260,"byte_end":465},{"index":4,"byte_start":465,"byte_end":562},{"index":5,"byte_start":562,"byte_end":637},{"index":6,"byte_start":637,"byte_end":833},{"index":7,"byte_start":833,"byte_end":930},{"index":8,"byte_start":930,"byte_end":950},{"index":9,"byte_start":950,"byte_end":1089},{"index":10,"byte_start":1089,"byte_end":1117},{"index":11,"byte_start":1117,"byte_end":1195},{"index":12,"byte_start":1195,"byte_end":1233},{"index":13,"byte_start":1233,"byte_end":1379},{"index":14,"byte_start":1379,"byte_end":1633},{"index":15,"byte_start":1633,"byte_end":1666},{"index":16,"byte_start":1666,"byte_end":1826},{"index":17,"byte_start":1826,"byte_end":1877},{"index":18,"byte_start":1877,"byte_end":1901},{"index":19,"byte_start":1901,"byte_end":2055},{"index":20,"byte_start":2055,"byte_end":2078},{"index":21,"byte_start":2078,"byte_end":2189},{"index":22,"byte_start":2189,"byte_end":2352},{"index":23,"byte_start":2352,"byte_end":2478},{"index":24,"byte_start":2478,"byte_end":2577}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":195},{"index":1,"byte_start":195,"byte_end":355},{"index":2,"byte_start":355,"byte_end":572}]}', 'role': 'user'}], 'model