tely. If you\'re on the phone, it\'s best not to let this person know that\'s what you\'re doing though. If your friend tells you that she/he is going to commit suicide, get help immediately, even if they tell you to keep it secret. 2  It is better to anger a friend than lose the actual human being.\\\\n\\\\n\\",\\"question\\":\\"how to stop a person from commiting suicide\\"}","answer":"Based on the given passages, to stop a person from committing suicide, one should:\\n\\n1. Be willing to talk about suicide with the person in danger.\\n2. Ask questions in a non-threatening way.\\n3. If the person is in immediate danger, they should see a mental health professional or doctor immediately.\\n4. Call 911 or take them to the emergency room if necessary.\\n5. Encourage the person to speak to a family member, counselor, or suicide crisis line.\\n6. Seek help from a friend or contact the police if the person has ideas, a plan, and the means to commit suicide.\\n7. Even if the person asks you to keep it a secret, it is better to get help immediately.\\n\\nNote: The given passages provide various suggestions and precautions to address potential suicide situations. However, it is important to seek professional advice and support in such cases.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":107},{"index":1,"byte_start":107,"byte_end":147},{"index":2,"byte_start":147,"byte_end":262},{"index":3,"byte_start":262,"byte_end":350},{"index":4,"byte_start":350,"byte_end":411},{"index":5,"byte_start":411,"byte_end":682},{"index":6,"byte_start":682,"byte_end":859},{"index":7,"byte_start":859,"byte_end":920},{"index":8,"byte_start":920,"byte_end":1139},{"index":9,"byte_start":1139,"byte_end":1334},{"index":10,"byte_start":1334,"byte_end":1429},{"index":11,"byte_start":1429,"byte_end":1557},{"index":12,"byte_start":1557,"byte_end":1687}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":147},{"index":1,"byte_start":147,"byte_end"